Ansible's YAML Jinja filters do not preserve trust metadata on parsed values and cannot reliably handle vaulted values during YAML operations. When parsing trusted YAML strings with from_yaml or from_yaml_all  the trust metadata is lost. When dumping data with vaulted values using to_yaml or to_nice_yaml  undecryptable values can cause failures even when vault tags could preserve the ciphertext. from_yaml from_yaml_all to_yaml to_nice_yaml dump_vault_tags {{ value | from_yaml }}
{{ value | from_yaml_all }}
{{ original | to_yaml(dump_vault_tags=True) }}
{{ original | to_nice_yaml(dump_vault_tags=True) }}
{{ list_with_undecrypted | to_yaml(dump_vault_tags=False) }}

